{
  "book": "enos",
  "bookName": "Enos",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 422.902,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it came to pass that I, Enos, knowing my father",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.431,
      "end": 5.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he was a just man\u2014",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.329,
      "end": 7.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he taught me in his language,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 7.645,
      "end": 10.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also in the nurture and admonition of the Lord\u2014",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.029,
      "end": 13.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and blessed be the name of my God for it\u2014",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.031,
      "end": 17.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will tell you of the wrestle which I had before God,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.415,
      "end": 19.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before I received a remission of my sins.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 20.556,
      "end": 23.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I went to hunt beasts in the forests;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 23.894,
      "end": 29.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the words which I had often heard my father speak concerning eternal life",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 29.74,
      "end": 33.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the joy of the saints, sunk deep into my heart.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.764,
      "end": 35.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my soul hungered;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 35.616,
      "end": 37.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I kneeled down before my Maker,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 38.072,
      "end": 42.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I cried unto him in mighty prayer and supplication for mine own soul;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 42.896,
      "end": 45.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the day long did I cry unto him;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 45.862,
      "end": 47.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and when the night came",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 47.946,
      "end": 50.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I did still raise my voice high",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 50.262,
      "end": 51.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it reached the heavens.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 52.567,
      "end": 55.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there came a voice unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 55.301,
      "end": 57.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Enos, thy sins are forgiven thee,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 57.803,
      "end": 59.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt be blessed.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 60.108,
      "end": 62.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Enos, knew that God could not lie;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 62.935,
      "end": 65.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, my guilt was swept away.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 65.844,
      "end": 68.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said: Lord, how is it done?",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 68.753,
      "end": 71.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me: Because of thy faith in Christ,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 71.766,
      "end": 74.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom thou hast never before heard nor seen.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 74.686,
      "end": 76.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many years pass away",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 76.491,
      "end": 79.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before he shall manifest himself in the flesh;",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 79.504,
      "end": 81.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, go to,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 81.217,
      "end": 83.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thy faith hath made thee whole.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 84.08,
      "end": 87.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, it came to pass that when I had heard these words",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 87.418,
      "end": 92.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I began to feel a desire for the welfare of my brethren, the Nephites;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 93.031,
      "end": 96.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I did pour out my whole soul unto God for them.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 97.194,
      "end": 99.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And while I was thus struggling in the spirit,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 99.975,
      "end": 103.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the voice of the Lord came into my mind again, saying:",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 103.917,
      "end": 109.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will visit thy brethren according to their diligence in keeping my commandments.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 109.205,
      "end": 111.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have given unto them this land,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 111.614,
      "end": 113.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is a holy land;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 113.512,
      "end": 115.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I curse it not",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 115.41,
      "end": 117.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be for the cause of iniquity;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 118.144,
      "end": 122.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I will visit thy brethren according as I have said;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 122.271,
      "end": 126.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their transgressions will I bring down with sorrow upon their own heads.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 127.316,
      "end": 130.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after I, Enos, had heard these words,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 130.468,
      "end": 133.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my faith began to be unshaken in the Lord;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 133.295,
      "end": 138.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I prayed unto him with many long strugglings for my brethren, the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 138.805,
      "end": 142.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after I had prayed and labored with all diligence,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 143.118,
      "end": 144.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord said unto me:",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 144.877,
      "end": 149.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will grant unto thee according to thy desires, because of thy faith.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 150.201,
      "end": 153.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, this was the desire which I desired of him\u2014",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 153.725,
      "end": 157.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if it should so be that my people, the Nephites,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 157.481,
      "end": 159.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should fall into transgression,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 159.89,
      "end": 161.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by any means be destroyed,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 162.113,
      "end": 164.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites should not be destroyed,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 165.033,
      "end": 170.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord God would preserve a record of my people, the Nephites;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 170.182,
      "end": 173.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even if it so be by the power of his holy arm,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 173.381,
      "end": 178.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it might be brought forth at some future day unto the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 178.623,
      "end": 181.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that, perhaps, they might be brought unto salvation\u2014",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 182.275,
      "end": 186.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For at the present our strugglings were vain in restoring them to the true faith.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 186.681,
      "end": 188.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they swore in their wrath that,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 188.811,
      "end": 190.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it were possible,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 190.477,
      "end": 193.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would destroy our records and us,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 193.536,
      "end": 196.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also all the traditions of our fathers.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 197.002,
      "end": 201.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I knowing that the Lord God was able to preserve our records,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 201.547,
      "end": 204.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I cried unto him continually, for he had said unto me:",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 205.024,
      "end": 207.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Whatsoever thing ye shall ask in faith,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 207.758,
      "end": 210.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "believing that ye shall receive in the name of Christ,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 210.864,
      "end": 212.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall receive it.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 213.169,
      "end": 214.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I had faith,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 215.021,
      "end": 216.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did cry unto God",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 217.151,
      "end": 219.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would preserve the records;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 219.281,
      "end": 225.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he covenanted with me that he would bring them forth unto the Lamanites in his own due time.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 226.23,
      "end": 230.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Enos, knew it would be according to the covenant which he had made;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 231.1,
      "end": 233.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore my soul did rest.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 233.73,
      "end": 235.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord said unto me:",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 235.628,
      "end": 238.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thy fathers have also required of me this thing;",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 238.827,
      "end": 242.31,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall be done unto them according to their faith;",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 242.49,
      "end": 245.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for their faith was like unto thine.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 245.724,
      "end": 251.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that I, Enos, went about among the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 251.941,
      "end": 254.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "prophesying of things to come,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 254.35,
      "end": 257.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and testifying of the things which I had heard and seen.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 258.559,
      "end": 263.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I bear record that the people of Nephi did seek diligently",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 263.522,
      "end": 266.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to restore the Lamanites unto the true faith in God.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 266.721,
      "end": 268.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But our labors were vain;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 268.805,
      "end": 270.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their hatred was fixed,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 270.75,
      "end": 273.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were led by their evil nature",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 273.716,
      "end": 278.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they became wild, and ferocious, and a blood-thirsty people,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 278.772,
      "end": 281.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "full of idolatry and filthiness;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 281.228,
      "end": 284.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "feeding upon beasts of prey; dwelling in tents,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 284.427,
      "end": 292.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and wandering about in the wilderness with a short skin girdle about their loins and their heads shaven;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 292.27,
      "end": 296.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their skill was in the bow, and in the cimeter, and the ax.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 296.908,
      "end": 300.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many of them did eat nothing save it was raw meat;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 300.432,
      "end": 303.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were continually seeking to destroy us.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 304.177,
      "end": 307.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people of Nephi did till the land,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 307.979,
      "end": 310.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and raise all manner of grain, and of fruit,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 310.527,
      "end": 311.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and flocks of herds,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 312.1,
      "end": 315.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and flocks of all manner of cattle of every kind,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 315.577,
      "end": 319.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and goats, and wild goats, and also many horses.",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 319.74,
      "end": 322.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were exceedingly many prophets among us.",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 322.939,
      "end": 326.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the people were a stiffnecked people, hard to understand.",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 327.056,
      "end": 330.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was nothing save it was exceeding harshness,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 330.626,
      "end": 335.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "preaching and prophesying of wars, and contentions, and destructions,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 335.404,
      "end": 337.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continually reminding them of death,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 338.092,
      "end": 340.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the duration of eternity,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 340.315,
      "end": 342.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the judgments and the power of God,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 343.003,
      "end": 345.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all these things\u2014stirring them up continually",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 345.784,
      "end": 348.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to keep them in the fear of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 348.565,
      "end": 351.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say there was nothing short of these things,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 351.578,
      "end": 354.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and exceedingly great plainness of speech,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 354.498,
      "end": 358.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "would keep them from going down speedily to destruction.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 358.3,
      "end": 361.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner do I write concerning them.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 362.091,
      "end": 366.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I saw wars between the Nephites and Lamanites in the course of my days.",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 367.322,
      "end": 370.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I began to be old,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 370.335,
      "end": 376.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and an hundred and seventy and nine years had passed away from the time that our father Lehi left Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 377.377,
      "end": 380.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I saw that I must soon go down to my grave,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 380.715,
      "end": 383.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having been wrought upon by the power of God",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 383.914,
      "end": 387.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I must preach and prophesy unto this people,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 387.577,
      "end": 390.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and declare the word according to the truth which is in Christ.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 391.147,
      "end": 393.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I have declared it in all my days,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 393.649,
      "end": 396.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have rejoiced in it above that of the world.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 396.976,
      "end": 400.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I soon go to the place of my rest, which is with my Redeemer;",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 401.103,
      "end": 403.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I know that in him I shall rest.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 403.605,
      "end": 405.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I rejoice in the day",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 405.643,
      "end": 408.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when my mortal shall put on immortality,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 408.795,
      "end": 410.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall stand before him;",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 410.879,
      "end": 413.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then shall I see his face with pleasure,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 413.381,
      "end": 414.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will say unto me:",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 415.14,
      "end": 416.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Come unto me, ye blessed,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 417.131,
      "end": 421.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there is a place prepared for you in the mansions of my Father.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 421.398,
      "end": 422.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 138
    }
  ]
}